From: Guohan Lu <securely1g@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Advertise CcInfo from imported Debian library rules

Common's native cc_shared_library linked through the development import
libhiredis.so but lost the runtime package's libhiredis.so.1.1.0 directory.
Both rules already return CcInfo. Advertising it lets the native graph aspect
visit their runtime-library metadata and retain that directory.

This is an original local repair. Both upstream files still omit the provider
advertisement at 403a8b5dc7fe80d31156d92f9c14789f9f547a50:
https://github.com/bazel-contrib/rules_distroless/blob/403a8b5dc7fe80d31156d92f9c14789f9f547a50/apt/private/so_library.bzl
https://github.com/bazel-contrib/rules_distroless/blob/403a8b5dc7fe80d31156d92f9c14789f9f547a50/apt/private/cc_deb_library.bzl

diff --git a/apt/private/cc_deb_library.bzl b/apt/private/cc_deb_library.bzl
--- a/apt/private/cc_deb_library.bzl
+++ b/apt/private/cc_deb_library.bzl
@@ -38,6 +38,7 @@
 
 cc_deb_library = rule(
     implementation = _cc_deb_library_impl,
+    provides = [CcInfo],
     attrs = {
         "hdrs": attr.label_list(allow_files = True),
         "deps": attr.label_list(providers = [CcInfo]),
diff --git a/apt/private/so_library.bzl b/apt/private/so_library.bzl
--- a/apt/private/so_library.bzl
+++ b/apt/private/so_library.bzl
@@ -59,6 +59,7 @@
 
 so_library = rule(
     implementation = _so_library_impl,
+    provides = [CcInfo],
     attrs = {
         "dynamic_libs": attr.label_list(allow_files = True),
     },
